 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "A book for the scriptures, rain for «من فوقهم» and wheat for «من تحت أرجلهم» (provision), each leaving before the next clause. Al-Muyassar's first-person «فأنزلنا… وأنبتنا» not used. STAGING v4: A town by day. 66:1-16 is a counterfactual: the group of People of the Book only stands (nothing acted, no rain or growth on the stage); the book, rain and wheat plates carry the meaning as symbols, with the camera tilting up and down on 66:13 and 66:15. 66:17 a smaller group (the moderate community) appears beside them; on 66:22 the larger group turns away (the many whose deeds are evil)."
 },
